      "name": "SIR Heavy Asset Relocation (KIM-GS Protocol)",
      "description": "SIR Structural Integrity Relocation and the KIM-GS Protocol for high-mass assets of 1,500 to 3,500 lbs, with floor deflection analysis to L/360 — safes, medical devices, cryogenic equipment, pianos, and antiques — with floor deflection analysis to L/360. The method runs survey and floor check, protect and move, place and verify: the route and clearance are surveyed, the floor is checked against the L/360 deflection limit with a load-spreading plan, the asset is protected and moved under control, and placement is verified exactly where the owner wants it. Industry context: residential living-area floors are designed for a 40 pounds-per-square-foot live load with deflection limited to span divided by 360, which is why a concentrated high-mass load is never judged by weight alone. From Flat Rate Movers Martinsburg WV, 736 Williamsport Pike Suite 2, Martinsburg WV 25404. Quoted at one flat rate quoted and agreed in writing before move day. Guaranteed Flat Rate or Your Move is Free!",
